---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="IAG - Quem Somos & Equipe">
    <!-- Hero da Página -->
    <section class="bg-iag-gradient relative py-20 text-white overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PGNpcmNsZSBjeD0iMSIgY3k9IjEiIHI9IjEiIGZpbGw9InJnYmEoMjU1LDI1NSwyNTUsMC4wNSkiLz48L3N2Zz4=')] opacity-30"></div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs inline-block mb-3">
                <span class="lang-pt">Nossa História & Equipe</span><span class="lang-en">Our History & Team</span>
            </span>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-4">
                <span class="lang-pt">Quem Somos</span><span class="lang-en">About Us</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                <span class="lang-pt">Unindo a excelência científica da biologia molecular à prática do campo para impulsionar a agricultura.</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Combining the scientific excellence of molecular biology with field practices to boost agriculture.</span>
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Nossa Missão / História -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
                    <span class="lang-pt">Ciência de Dados Genéticos para o Produtor Rural</span>
                    <span class="lang-en">Genetic Data Science for the Rural Producer</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    <span class="lang-pt">O Instituto Agro Genética (IAG) nasceu com o propósito claro de democratizar o acesso a ferramentas genéticas e diagnósticos de solos de alta precisão. Acreditamos que a tomada de decisão no campo deve ser baseada em dados concretos e rigor científico.</span>
                    <span class="lang-en">The Agro Genetics Institute (IAG) was born with the clear purpose of democratizing access to high-precision genetic tools and soil diagnostics. We believe that decision-making in the field must be based on concrete data and scientific rigor.</span>
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    <span class="lang-pt">Através de metodologias validadas e infraestrutura de ponta, oferecemos suporte contínuo desde o controle de qualidade de sementes até a recomendação exata de calagem e adubação, atuando como o principal parceiro tecnológico do agricultor brasileiro.</span>
                    <span class="lang-en">Through validated methodologies and state-of-the-art infrastructure, we offer continuous support from seed quality control to precise liming and fertilization recommendations, acting as the primary technological partner of the Brazilian farmer.</span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Valores -->
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center border-t border-slate-100 pt-16">
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl mx-auto mb-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2"><span class="lang-pt">Missão</span><span class="lang-en">Mission</span></h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        <span class="lang-pt">Entregar diagnósticos rápidos e precisos que maximizem a produtividade agrícola de forma sustentável e econômica.</span>
                        <span class="lang-en">Deliver fast and precise diagnostics that maximize agricultural productivity in a sustainable and economical way.</span>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl mx-auto mb-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-eye"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2"><span class="lang-pt">Visão</span><span class="lang-en">Vision</span></h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        <span class="lang-pt">Ser o laboratório referência em biologia molecular e análise de solos na Região Centro-Oeste e no Brasil.</span>
                        <span class="lang-en">Be the benchmark laboratory in molecular biology and soil analysis in the Central-West region and Brazil.</span>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl mx-auto mb-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2"><span class="lang-pt">Valores</span><span class="lang-en">Values</span></h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        <span class="lang-pt">Ética, rigor científico, transparência nos laudos, agilidade na entrega e compromisso com o resultado do cliente.</span>
                        <span class="lang-en">Ethics, scientific rigor, transparency in reports, agility in delivery, and commitment to the client's results.</span>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Nossa Equipe -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
                    <span class="lang-pt">Nossa Equipe Técnica & Fundadores</span>
                    <span class="lang-en">Our Technical Team & Founders</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600">
                    <span class="lang-pt">Profissionais experientes dedicados a transformar dados de laboratório em produtividade real no campo.</span>
                    <span class="lang-en">Experienced professionals dedicated to transforming laboratory data into real productivity in the field.</span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Grid de Fundadores (Destaque) -->
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <!-- Marcos Norio -->
                <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <div class="md:w-2/5 h-64 md:h-auto bg-slate-200 relative min-h-[250px]">
                        <img src="/norio.png" alt="Marcos Norio" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/75 via-transparent to-transparent md:hidden"></div>
                        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-white md:hidden">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl">Marcos Norio</h3>
                            <p class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Cofundador e Diretor Científico</span>
                                <span class="lang-en">Co-Founder & Scientific Director</span>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="md:w-3/5 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="hidden md:block mb-4">
                                <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-slate-900">Marcos Norio</h3>
                                <p class="text-emerald-600 text-sm font-semibold">
                                    <span class="lang-pt">Cofundador & Diretor Científico</span>
                                    <span class="lang-en">Co-Founder & Scientific Director</span>
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            
                            <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-bold mb-3">
                                <i class="fas fa-briefcase text-emerald-600 mr-1"></i>
                                <span class="lang-pt">37 Anos de Experiência em Soja</span>
                                <span class="lang-en">37 Years of Soybean Research Experience</span>
                            </p>
                            
                            <ul class="text-slate-600 text-xs space-y-2 mb-4 list-disc pl-4">
                                <li><strong>2023:</strong> Co-founder Agromarkers / Líder Programa de Pesquisa Latitude</li>
                                <li><strong>2021:</strong> Consultor e Sócio Fundador da Grandeo</li>
                                <li><strong>2011 - 2021:</strong> Líder do Programa de Pesquisa Brasil na GDM Brasil (Londrina/PR)</li>
                                <li><strong>2003 - 2011:</strong> Líder de Pesquisa na Monsanto do Brasil (Morrinhos/GO)</li>
                                <li><strong>1997 - 2003:</strong> Melhorista de Soja na Monsanto do Brasil</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
                            <p><strong><span class="lang-pt">Educação:</span><span class="lang-en">Education:</span></strong></p>
                            <p class="mt-1"><span class="lang-pt">Graduado em Agronomia pela UNESP Ilha Solteira (1985)</span><span class="lang-en">B.S. in Agronomy - UNESP (1985)</span></p>
                            <p><span class="lang-pt">Mestre em Fitopatologia pela UEL Londrina (1996)</span><span class="lang-en">M.S. in Phytopathology - UEL (1996)</span></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Junior -->
                <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <div class="md:w-2/5 h-64 md:h-auto bg-gradient-to-tr from-slate-800 to-emerald-950 flex items-center justify-center relative min-h-[250px]">
                        <!-- Avatar placeholder premium para o Junior -->
                        <div class="text-center text-white p-4">
                            <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl font-black mx-auto mb-3 shadow-md">
                                JR
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-lg">Junior</h4>
                            <p class="text-emerald-400 text-xs">Admin & Finance</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/75 via-transparent to-transparent md:hidden"></div>
                        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-white md:hidden">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl">Junior</h3>
                            <p class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Cofundador e Diretor Administrativo</span>
                                <span class="lang-en">Co-Founder & Managing Director</span>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="md:w-3/5 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="hidden md:block mb-4">
                                <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-slate-900">Junior</h3>
                                <p class="text-emerald-600 text-sm font-semibold">
                                    <span class="lang-pt">Cofundador & Diretor Administrativo e Financeiro</span>
                                    <span class="lang-en">Co-Founder & CFO</span>
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            
                            <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-bold mb-3">
                                <i class="fas fa-chart-line text-emerald-600 mr-1"></i>
                                <span class="lang-pt">30 Anos em Admin. & Finanças Corporativas</span>
                                <span class="lang-en">30 Years in Admin. & Corporate Finance</span>
                            </p>
                            
                            <ul class="text-slate-600 text-xs space-y-2 mb-4 list-disc pl-4">
                                <li><strong>2023:</strong> Co-founder da Agromarkers / Consultoria Financeira</li>
                                <li><strong>2014:</strong> Head Finance da GDM Genética do Brasil S.A. (Londrina/PR)</li>
                                <li><strong>2010:</strong> Reestruturação do Banco Pan com equipe BTG Pactual (São Paulo)</li>
                                <li><strong>2008:</strong> Projeto Open Banking em Madri / Gerente Executivo no Santander</li>
                                <li><strong>2007:</strong> Gerente Executivo de Processos - ABN Amro Bank</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
                            <p><strong><span class="lang-pt">Educação:</span><span class="lang-en">Education:</span></strong></p>
                            <p class="mt-1"><span class="lang-pt">Administração pela UEL Londrina</span><span class="lang-en">B.S. in Business Administration - UEL</span></p>
                            <p><span class="lang-pt">MBA Executivo pela FGV Rio de Janeiro</span><span class="lang-en">Executive MBA - FGV RJ</span></p>
                            <p><span class="lang-pt">Mestrado em Finanças Corporativas pela FGV São Paulo</span><span class="lang-en">M.S. in Corporate Finance - FGV SP</span></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Outros Colaboradores da Equipe -->
            <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-200 pt-16">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 text-center mb-10">
                    <span class="lang-pt">Cofundadores & Equipe Técnica</span><span class="lang-en">Co-Founders & Technical Staff</span>
                </h3>
                
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                    <!-- Matheus Hideki -->
                    <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 text-center hover:shadow-sm transition-shadow">
                        <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-4 shadow-sm">
                            MH
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">Matheus Hideki</h4>
                        <p class="text-amber-700 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
                            <span class="lang-pt">Cofundador & Coord. Solos</span>
                            <span class="lang-en">Co-Founder & Soil Coordinator</span>
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs italic">
                            <span class="lang-pt">Cofundador e responsável técnico de solos.</span>
                            <span class="lang-en">Co-founder and soil technical lead.</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Juliano -->
                    <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 text-center hover:shadow-sm transition-shadow">
                        <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-4 shadow-sm">
                            JU
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">Juliano</h4>
                        <p class="text-blue-700 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
                            <span class="lang-pt">Cofundador & Especialista Técnico</span>
                            <span class="lang-en">Co-Founder & Technical Specialist</span>
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs italic">
                            <span class="lang-pt">Cofundador e colaborador técnico.</span>
                            <span class="lang-en">Co-founder and technical contributor.</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
